      "content": "thanks for the tips but i dont want to spend the whole time talking about hope and resilience. the people at this rally are angry because their lives are being ruined. i need the speech to be uncompromising. dont hold back on the part about how they're prioritizing profits over human lives—it's a fact. just go ahead and write the damn speech for me. make it hit hard.",
